  "_about": "The one non-default parameter set per generator template id for the library-shape test (verification 02 §C.2 step 5, spec 04 §13): numbers x1.5 rounded to the editor step (integers to 1, floats to 0.01) and clamped to min/max, booleans flipped, enumerations the next option, Hidden (editor type 255) parameters unchanged; for interpret_text generators an alternate text with one extra item or line (the date pickers take another date, single-label buttons a second word). Drafted by rule from lekhboard/stencils/v4 on 2026-10-16 and reviewed by eye; build-batches.mjs fails on a generator id with no entry.",
